{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch light speed neutron a create a chain reaction splitting materials into more neutrons. The more neutrons the more money made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different materials have vastly different effects when hit:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fissile materials will make more neutrons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply Neutrons and redirect them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase profits of neutrons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perks with powerful synergies that gives you a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, random starting materials, and persistent unlocks will make sure the experience always feels fresh.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932160?t=1758050898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932160/9e3d994687b6a7eb8172bda2c59454b90a9103c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758050898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932160/e9baacac977e9b3134d1a22a78257497658062b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758050898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932160/e9baacac977e9b3134d1a22a78257497658062b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758050898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash c